  "note": "Annual election of councillors of Belfast Corporation, 15 January 1914: Falls Ward elected 2, one for the full term and one to complete the term of a vacant seat. Register remarks: 2 seats: Collins Re-elected; McDonnell Elected vice Donnelly resigned. John Boston was nominated in every ward in 1912-14 and polled a handful of votes in each."
